# Exemplars and templates are usually YOUR organisation's real documents -
# letterhead, board papers, contracts, pricing decks. This repo is public, so
# nothing in context/ is committed by default: everything is ignored except the
# READMEs that document the convention.
#
# To commit one file deliberately (a genuinely generic sample):
#     git add -f context/templates/"Report Template.docx"
#
# If none of your material is sensitive and you would rather it travelled with
# the repo, delete this file.

*
!*/
!README.md
!.gitignore
